    "detailed_description": "<strong>Break through Reality and build your own Fate!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/ac5a36b0961c5e9bcbe1a6b5b33a7e8f.poster.avif?t=1726300994\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/ac5a36b0961c5e9bcbe1a6b5b33a7e8f.webm?t=1726300994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/ac5a36b0961c5e9bcbe1a6b5b33a7e8f.mp4?t=1726300994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Essentia is an upcoming Action RPG sporting <strong>beautiful 2D/3D graphics</strong> and a real time combat system with some refreshing features.<br>Explore the world of <strong>Entis</strong> featuring diverse environments und many colorful characters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/fae01c34108c238854622810bfe18996.poster.avif?t=1726300994\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/fae01c34108c238854622810bfe18996.webm?t=1726300994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/fae01c34108c238854622810bfe18996.mp4?t=1726300994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Break through Reality and build your own Fate!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/ac5a36b0961c5e9bcbe1a6b5b33a7e8f.poster.avif?t=1726300994\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/ac5a36b0961c5e9bcbe1a6b5b33a7e8f.webm?t=1726300994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/ac5a36b0961c5e9bcbe1a6b5b33a7e8f.mp4?t=1726300994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Essentia is an upcoming Action RPG sporting <strong>beautiful 2D/3D graphics</strong> and a real time combat system with some refreshing features.<br>Explore the world of <strong>Entis</strong> featuring diverse environments und many colorful characters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/fae01c34108c238854622810bfe18996.poster.avif?t=1726300994\" width=600 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/fae01c34108c238854622810bfe18996.webm?t=1726300994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218370/extras/fae01c34108c238854622810bfe18996.mp4?t=1726300994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
